# Harness Core

- Always read `AGENTS.md` then `project.yaml` before acting.
- Reply to the user in **Portuguese**. Code, reasoning, vault notes, designs/tasks: **English**. Docstrings: **Portuguese**.
- Follow `INSTALL.md` if `harness/.setup-complete` is missing.
- SDD and delivery workflows: `harness/workflows/sdd.md`, `delivery-loop.md`, `parallel-orchestration.md`.
- Constitutions: `harness/constitutions/backend.md`, `frontend.md`, `data.md`, `messaging.md`.
- Visual supply: `harness/supply/` (assets + `visual-identity.md`).
- Local runtime: `project.yaml → runtime.local_mode` (`bundled_infra` | `external_infra`); use `harness/scripts/windows/start-all.bat` — do not spawn duplicate infra.
- Deploy target: `project.yaml → deploy.target` (`railway` | `portainer`); templates under `harness/templates/deploy/`.
- Backend: loguru via `app/src/core/logging.py`; FastAPI lifespan must ping required deps.
- Every product code task implicitly requires QA → security-analyst → code-reviewer.
- Auto-fix critical security findings; escalate to human after `gates.max_qa_security_review_retries`.
- Prefer parallel subagents for independent work.
- Keep `AGENTS.md` short; put deep knowledge in `vault/` (English) and harness docs.
